      "            Justice League  2018       2.513434e+06      0.000348        34.797185             0.034797\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Summary Statistics:\n",
      "  Total demand share: 1.000000\n",
      "  Total expected demand: 100,000\n",
      "  Movies with >1% share: 0\n",
      "  Movies with >0.1% share: 0\n"
